    "talent": [
      {
        "key": "虛界玄爪",
        "title": "虛界玄爪",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/22/84496276/47817b4476bcd8b44c86c87debf042f2_3230514379462004330.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd680>普通攻擊</color>\n造成2點 <color=#ffffff>物理傷害</color> 。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": null
      },
      {
        "key": "蝕滅火羽",
        "title": "蝕滅火羽",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/22/84496276/7a9812193a31b5db7241eb37d5bde879_4557341749872684515.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd680>元素戰技</color>\n造成3點 <color=#ff9999>火元素傷害</color> ，我方 <color=#ffffff>捨棄</color> 牌組頂部1張牌。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "斫劫源焰",
        "title": "斫劫源焰",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/22/84496276/1a55c58964c00fc5a5528047caa2851a_5155111901975229625.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd680>元素爆發</color>\n造成1點 <color=#ff9999>火元素傷害</color> ，對所有敵方後臺角色造成1點 <color=#ffffff>穿透傷害</color> 。雙方 <color=#ffffff>捨棄</color> 牌組頂部3張牌，自身附屬1層 <color=#ffffff>忿恨</color> 。\n<color=#ffffff>忿恨</color>\n<color=#ffd680>狀態</color>\n每層使所附屬角色造成的傷害和「元素爆發」造成的 <color=#ffffff>穿透傷害</color> +1。（可疊加，沒有上限）"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "忿恨",
        "title": "忿恨",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/22/84496276/93e7ef3294ffeb332ef5713f77fe5082_1586154691598143501.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd680>被動技能</color>\n【被動】我方每 <color=#ffffff>捨棄</color> 6張卡牌，自身附屬1層 <color=#ffffff>忿恨</color> 。\n<color=#ffffff>忿恨</color>\n<color=#ffd680>狀態</color>\n每層使所附屬角色造成的傷害和「元素爆發」造成的 <color=#ffffff>穿透傷害</color> +1。（可疊加，沒有上限）"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "火元素傷害",
        "title": "火元素傷害",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/22/84496276/d714b3b669cc08d1d8e34464fd7a3630_6957574830952968930.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "附著 <color=#ff9999>火元素</color> ，可發生元素反應：\n【 <color=#ff9999>火元素</color> + <color=#36ffff>冰元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>融化：</color> 本傷害+2\n【 <color=#ff9999>火元素</color> + <color=#80bfff>水元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>蒸發：</color> 本傷害+2\n【 <color=#ff9999>火元素</color> + <color=#ffacff>雷元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>超載：</color> 本傷害+2，目標強制切換到下一個角色\n【 <color=#ff9999>火元素</color> + <color=#99ff88>草元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>燃燒：</color> 本傷害+1，生成回合結束時造成1點火元素傷害的[ <color=#ffffff>燃燒烈焰</color> ]（可用次數1，最多疊加到2）\n<color=#ffffff>燃燒烈焰</color>\n<color=#ffd780>召喚物</color>\n<color=#ffffff>結束階段：</color> 造成1點 <color=#ff9999>火元素傷害</color> 。\n<color=#ffffff>可用次數：1，最多叠加到2</color>"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "規則解釋",
        "title": "規則解釋",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/22/84496276/07bae546ac7c69ef6402170b283840c5_5409217213477297292.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffffff>物理傷害</color>\n物理傷害不會附著元素，也不會發生元素反應。\n<color=#ffffff>穿透傷害</color>\n穿透傷害無法受到傷害加成，但是也無法被護盾、傷害免疫等效果抵消。\n<color=#ffffff>捨棄</color>\n透過行動牌或角色技能的效果，將行動牌從手牌或牌庫中棄置。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      }
    ]
  }
